OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who accidentally overdosed
OL,4,Aon paracetamol learns to walk and talk
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe parents of a student who suffered
OL,8,Forgan failure and nearly died after
OL,9,Faccidentally overdosing on paracetamol
OL,10,Fhave spoken of the distress it caused
OL,11,Fand said they have "no idea how it
OL,12,Fhappened so quickly".
OL,14,FRiley Lubas, 20, came down with a bad
OL,15,Fcold in March 2025 in his first year at
OL,16,Funiversity, and took two over-the
OL,17,Fcounter medicines without realising
OL,18,Fthey both contained paracetamol.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
