OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who accidentally overdosed
OL,4,Aon paracetamol learns to walk and talk
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter being placed on life support and
OL,8,Fenduring weeks in hospital, he went on
OL,9,Fto make a miraculous recovery, and has
OL,10,Feven relearned how to walk and talk.
OL,12,FThe Royal College of General
OL,13,FPractitioners Cymru Wales advised
OL,14,Fpeople to always "read the label
OL,15,Fcarefully" and seek advice from a GP
OL,16,Fbefore taking medication.
